+def main(grid: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
+    """
+    Mirror the colored source components across the full green guide line, then connect each original-copy pair with the shortest clear orthogonal path.
+
+    Input structure:
+    - The background is black, with one complete green guide line filling either a whole row or a whole column.
+    - Exactly one half of the grid contains 2-3 small 4-connected colored components; each source color is distinct and is not black, green, or grey.
+    - Grey wall segments of length 1-3 may appear on both halves and act as blockers; the opposite half starts empty of colored source components.
